<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;OBLIGOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any party that is contractually obligated to fulfill the terms of the agreement, which can also include the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.15&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section addressing the waiver of immunity provisions that may apply under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENT OF TAXABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event that results in the Borrower being subject to tax obligations, potentially allowing for certain conditions to change the performance duties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conditions under which the tax-exempt status of advances changes due to misapplication of proceeds or legislative action, impacting the borrower's tax liability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARENT COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The company that owns or controls the Borrower, possibly holding more than 50% of voting power as mentioned in the context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIAL COUNSEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Special Counsel refers to the attorney or legal advisor appointed in connection with applicable law and necessary actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.11&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section that details the operational account requirements for the management of funds under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SENIOR DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the high-priority debt levels that have priority in repayment, affecting the credit risk assessment of the borrower in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Senior Debt describes the debt obligations that must be rated adequately as part of the financing conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Senior Debt refers to the bonds of the Borrower issued under the Trust Agreement that are not guaranteed by any other Person or subject to any other credit enhancement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Senior Debt refers to the debt obligations that the Borrower owes to the Bank, which have priority over other debts in case of liquidation or bankruptcy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Senior Debt refers to the primary loans that are prioritized in terms of repayment, most relevant in discussions concerning the Borrower and the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific occurrences including increases in costs to the Bank or decreases in effective returns which affect the obligations concerning the Advances under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The entity designated to manage the administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement on behalf of the lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT B FORM OF REQUEST FOR ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exhibit B outlines the specific request for advance as stipulated in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70c3e90c4828ae1627354b7bc48dcced97fd4274becc65d961ead52e4ec9cbf4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HAZARDOUS MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hazardous Materials refer to substances that may create liability or issues related to environmental regulations, particularly as they pertain to properties owned or operated by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Substances that impose environmental risks and liabilities for the Borrower under Environmental Laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"all explosive or radioactive substances or wastes and all hazardous or toxic substances, wastes or other pollutants, including petroleum or petroleum."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Subsidiary of the Borrower refers to any company that is controlled by the Borrower and may also have obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Subsidiary refers to a company that is completely or partially owned by another company, known as the parent company, and is involved in the Borrower's business operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Subsidiary refers to a legal entity that is controlled by the Borrower, which may be involved in transactions as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Subsidiary refers to any entity controlled by the Borrower that may affect the overall financial condition of the Borrower and is subject to the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any subsidiary of the Borrower, which is ultimately controlled by the parent company, impacting ownership and control dynamics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNING BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Governing Board is responsible for reviewing and approving the Borrower's monthly reports, overseeing the Borrower's financial governance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section focusing on liens and the borrower's obligations regarding securing the lender's interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any legal individual or entity referenced in the agreement, signifying obligations or rights under the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any natural person, corporation, limited liability company, trust, joint venture, association, company, partnership, Governmental Authority, or other entity recognized in the credit context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person means any individual or legal entity that has obligations or rights under the agreements and is responsible for being liable in various financial contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"any individual or legal entity that is capable of entering into a contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIDOR FLOATING POOL RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The LIDOR Floating Pool Rate is an interest rate benchmark based on the cost of the 30-Day LIBOR Rate, used to determine interest payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COST TO THE BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The additional financial requirement that the Bank incurs when responding to Events related to the Advances, impacting repayment calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITY TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURITY TRUSTEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity appointed to hold and manage the collateral on behalf of all lenders involved in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT C TRUST AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exhibit C describes the trust agreement relevant to the financial arrangements within the credit context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70c3e90c4828ae1627354b7bc48dcced97fd4274becc65d961ead52e4ec9cbf4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY LIABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term defined in Regulation D of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System, related to currency liabilities. It signifies obligations tied to the Eurocurrency market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liabilities that consist of or include funds borrowed in foreign currencies, requiring additional interest payments as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIBOR FLOATING POOL RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The reference rate used for calculating the interest payable on the Advances based on market conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DETERMINATION OF TAXABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Determination of Taxability refers to assessments made regarding any tax implications that could impact the legality of the Advances made by the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JULY 20, 2012&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The executed date of the Trade Finance Facility Agreement is July 20, 2012, marking the official signing and commencement of the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The official date when the TRADE FINANCE FACILITY AGREEMENT was signed, signifying the commencement of the contractual relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the TRADE FINANCE FACILITY AGREEMENT was signed, initiating the contractual obligations between the parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the Trade Finance Facility Agreement was signed, marking the formal commencement of contractual obligations and binding terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the affidavit was acknowledged and signed, marking the formal commencement of the acting appointment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99642fbfed52a1842d14fd673fccd3fb541ca1ce531ec322b8b065be2a8fc1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fd617d0485c978e60e12da1e457bda833d1b87dd45e5f43cd7d0b303b8165b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section that addresses fundamental changes that could affect the credit agreement's stability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOARD OF GOVERNORS OF THE FEDERAL RESERVE SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The governing body responsible for supervising and regulating the U.S. banking system, including all national banks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Guarantees are commitments made by a Person to assume liability for another's Indebtedness, thereby providing additional assurance to creditors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIDOR RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The LIDOR Rate is the offered quotation for interest on 30-day U.S. Dollar deposits in the London interbank market, which is published daily by financial institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASIS FOR DETERMINING SUCH AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The framework or criteria established by the Bank for calculating payments due to Events that alter the terms of the Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lien represents a legal right or claim against the Borrower's asset, acting as security for the loan and ensuring the lender can recover funds if necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal claim against a borrower's asset granted to the lender as security for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal claim against the Borrower's property, which may restrict the ability to create further liabilities or to sell assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal right or claim against a Borrower's asset as security for the loan, which may not be imposed except as permitted in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lien means a legal right or claim against a borrower's asset, ensuring the lender can secure repayment through the borrower's property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUST AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal agreement that outlines the rules and conditions relevant to the transactions and relationships among the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding document outlining the terms and conditions governing a trust arrangement, including the rights and obligations of parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal document referenced in the note that governs certain aspects of the Borrower's obligations and collateral management related to the financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal document that defines the terms and conditions under which certain obligations are managed and regulated, involving the Borrower and other parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agreement defining the terms and obligations associated with current expenses and payments under the Facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agreement relevant to the dealings of the Borrower and the Bank, establishing trust-related terms under the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement dated January 1, 1974, governs the relationship between the Borrower and U.S. Bank National Association regarding the administration of funds and responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement governs the terms and conditions related to the financing, including the provisions regarding revenues and liens."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement is a formal contract governing the obligations of Borrower regarding the payment of the current expense under the agreement, dated as of January 1, 1974."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement is a formal, legally binding contract that outlines the rights, obligations, and terms between the Borrower and the Bank regarding the financial arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement outlines specific terms and conditions relating to the investment obligations and the handling of assets involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement outlines the obligations concerning the management and use of proceeds from the loan, ensuring compliance by the Borrower and its subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement outlines the terms regarding the priority of payments related to Current Expenses associated with the borrowing and loan management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement pertains to the management and distribution of funds or collateral as specified in the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement relates to the management and disbursement of funds under the Agreement, which can impact the Borrower's obligations and the priority of payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement under which Current Expenses are defined and which governs the bonds of the Borrower issued."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70c3e90c4828ae1627354b7bc48dcced97fd4274becc65d961ead52e4ec9cbf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228c502c8880a404029e4a01d826cc4e22cf95111ea9fdd014095cae26e5c434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b53aa3032d7724a08ebc102d9b31f54173425439d5eff944136fbb26b5aa2110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCLUDED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Excluded Taxes means Taxes other than Indemnified Taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are not borne by the bank, including certain income taxes and branch profit taxes, as per the agreement's definitions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREPAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PREPAYMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prepayment refers to the Borrower's right to pay back any Advance in whole or in part before the scheduled Maturity Date without a penalty."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial Statements are the formal documents that the Borrower must provide to the Bank, outlining its financial condition and operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADE FINANCE FACILITY AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal agreement outlining the terms related to lending and trade finance between Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority and Citibank, N.A."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal contract entered into on July 20, 2012, between Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority and Citibank, N.A., outlining the financing terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract between the PUERTO RICO ELECTRIC POWER AUTHORITY and Citibank that outlines the rights, obligations, and terms regarding the financing arrangement, including loan repayment details and interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trade Finance Facility Agreement, dated July 20, 2012, serves as a formal contract between the Borrower and the lender, defining the terms of the advance requested."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the specific credit agreement mentioned at the end of the text, outlining the terms and conditions of financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c4187c4c97cb9c42f524362397c7bbedcd1ace1fe2352097eca90b08e8f3b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99642fbfed52a1842d14fd673fccd3fb541ca1ce531ec322b8b065be2a8fc1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing investments, advances, guarantees, and acquisitions that relate to the borrower's financial activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Closing Date marks the specific date on which the agreement comes into effect and the lender begins making Advances to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date marks the specific date when the Borrower and Bank finalize their agreements, signifying the commencement of the contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the credit agreement becomes effective, leading to the initiation of obligations for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the legal and operational provisions of the agreement become effective, marking the commencement of the contractual relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date upon which all parties sign the agreement, specifically set as July 20, 2012."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL ADVERSE EFFECT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Material Adverse Effect signifies a development that could negatively impact the Borrower's business or ability to repay under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Material Adverse Effect signifies a significant negative impact on the Borrower's business, assets, or ability to fulfill obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A significant negative impact on the Borrower's operations or financial condition that could change the risk assessment of the loan's compliance and repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect describes the negative impact that could occur due to the Borrower's failure to maintain certain standards or conditions as outlined in the agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect refers to a negative impact that could arise from specific transactions or changes in operations, influencing the Borrower's ability to meet obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect refers to significant negative impacts that could arise from the Borrower's failure to meet obligations, potentially affecting the company’s operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Material Adverse Effect' refers to a significant negative impact that could influence the Borrower or the overall agreement, often considered in legal contexts to assess compliance and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Formal communication from the Bank to inform the Borrower about any Events affecting the cost or terms related to the Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Written Notice is the formal communication method required for any changes in the address or telecopy number of the parties involved in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial conduct."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUEST FOR ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A request by the Borrower for an Advance as per the requirements stated in Section 2.03."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Request for Advance is a formal document that outlines the terms and conditions under which the borrower can request funds from the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The official notification from the Borrower to the Bank specifying the amount and purpose of the funds requested as an Advance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70c3e90c4828ae1627354b7bc48dcced97fd4274becc65d961ead52e4ec9cbf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the Trade Finance Facility Agreement between the bank and the Authority, dated July 20, 2011, establishing prior credit arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Existing Facility refers to the financing arrangement that the Bank must have received full payment of all amounts due."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.06 outlines the terms and conditions regarding the prepayment of Advances by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FISCAL YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Fiscal Year defines the annual period over which the Borrower is required to report its financial statements to the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fiscal Year is used in the context of the Borrower's financial covenants, indicating the time frame for compliance with payment obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-228c502c8880a404029e4a01d826cc4e22cf95111ea9fdd014095cae26e5c434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUERTO RICO ELECTRIC POWER AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A government-owned corporation in Puerto Rico responsible for the generation, transmission, and distribution of electricity."&lt;SEP&gt;"A governmental entity responsible for the generation, transmission, and distribution of electric power in Puerto Rico, involved in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal business entity operating in the energy sector as a public corporation responsible for generating, transmitting, and distributing electric power in Puerto Rico."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal entity that likely engages in commercial activities related to power generation and distribution in Puerto Rico."&lt;SEP&gt;"A public corporation and government instrumentality of the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico that is obligated to repay the loan provided by Citibank under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A public corporation and government instrumentality of the Commonwealth responsible for providing electric power in Puerto Rico."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority is identified as the Borrower in the Request for Advance, responsible for requesting financial assistance under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority, represented by Josue Antonio Colon Ortiz, is a public corporation engaged in the provision of electric power and involved in a credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that holds the General Fund under the Trust Agreement, which is utilized by the Borrower for repayment of obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The party responsible for fulfilling the terms of the TRADE FINANCE FACILITY AGREEMENT, including repayment obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdee22fff5b0749e919bec54cb42823587fab138c06ed283f8b2803032ed517b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c4187c4c97cb9c42f524362397c7bbedcd1ace1fe2352097eca90b08e8f3b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99642fbfed52a1842d14fd673fccd3fb541ca1ce531ec322b8b065be2a8fc1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fd617d0485c978e60e12da1e457bda833d1b87dd45e5f43cd7d0b303b8165b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section concerning hedge agreements that allow the borrower to manage financial risk."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMONWEALTH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GOVERNMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico, the jurisdiction governing the borrower and associated agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the political entity governing Puerto Rico, relevant in the context of tax-exempt payments under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities owned or controlled by the Borrower that may also be bound by obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are owned or controlled by the Borrower, involved in its operations and may execute transactions on its behalf."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries refer to entities that are owned or controlled by the Borrower, which can have implications in terms of liabilities outlined in the indemnity provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries refer to the companies that are owned or controlled by the Borrower, contributing to the overall business structure and operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries are defined as legal entities owned by the Borrower that contribute to its business operations and are subject to the same obligations and compliance as the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries are entities that are part of the Borrower’s overall structure, and they are included when assessing the Borrower's financial state and obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries of the Borrower are organizations that are legally part of the Borrower, sharing obligations and responsibilities as stipulated in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documentation provided by the Bank detailing the basis for determining amounts due under the credit agreement in relation to Events."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACT NO. 83&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legislation enacted by the Legislature of Puerto Rico, relevant to the obligations set forth in the agreement regarding financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial obligations imposed by Governmental Authorities that affect the Borrower's financial responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes represent mandatory financial charges imposed by governmental entities, excluding those categorized as Excluded Taxes in the agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the laws and rules governing the taxation obligations of the borrower as outlined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACILITY DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All documents rendered under the credit agreement including the Note and various resolutions, forming an essential part of the transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Comprises various legal documents associated with the Facility, outlining terms, conditions, and obligations relating to the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents related to the execution, delivery, and performance of the agreements associated with the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Documents refer to the formal documents associated with the credit facility that the Borrower is a party to, establishing binding agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The set of documents associated with the credit agreement that outline the rights and obligations of the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURED PARTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Principal Amount refers to the total amount of Advances that the Borrower must repay to the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIBOR RATE RESERVE PERCENTAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Percentage required by the Bank to maintain reserves related to Eurocurrency Liabilities, affecting the overall interest calculation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CITIBANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution providing banking and financial services, which is the lender in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement with Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial institution that provides a loan to the Borrower and is responsible for disbursing funds as per the terms outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global financial services company and a member of Citigroup, providing consumer and commercial banking services, investment banking, and wealth management."&lt;SEP&gt;"A national banking association organized under the laws of the United States and authorized to do business in the Commonwealth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A. is the financial institution providing the loan to the Borrower as outlined in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A., represented by Abigail Ayala, is involved in a credit agreement and provides banking services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c4187c4c97cb9c42f524362397c7bbedcd1ace1fe2352097eca90b08e8f3b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99642fbfed52a1842d14fd673fccd3fb541ca1ce531ec322b8b065be2a8fc1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section addressing transactions with affiliates to ensure compliance in the borrower's financial dealings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVAILABILITY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Availability Period is the defined time frame during which the Borrower can utilize the Facility Amount granted by the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Availability Period is the timeframe during which the Borrower can draw the Available Amount from the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The period during which the Borrower can access the Advances as outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The time frame from the Effective Date until the earliest of the specified termination conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The time period during which the Bank is willing to make Advances available to the Borrower, as defined in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL ADVERSE CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Material Adverse Change refers to any event that, in the judgment of the Bank, significantly affects the Borrower's financial condition or ability to repay."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Material Adverse Change refers to any significant negative alteration in the financial condition, operations, or prospects of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Change indicates a significant alteration in the financial condition of the Borrower that could adversely affect its obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liens are legal rights or claims against the Borrower's assets, securing debts including those from Capital Lease Obligations as defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens refer to legal claims or rights against the Borrower's assets, which could arise as a result of defaults or other obligations as specified in the Trust Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFIRMATIVE COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing the affirmative obligations of the borrower in the credit agreement, including the payment of obligations and compliance with laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL FUNDS EFFECTIVE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate indicating the weighted average cost of overnight federal funds transactions, serving as a benchmark interest rate relevant to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used to calculate the repayment obligations that may accrue on Advances made by the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certificates refer to the documentation that the Bank may require from the Borrower as a condition for extending the Availability Period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADE FINANCE FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A structured credit arrangement between Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority and Citibank, N.A. for the purpose of trade financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e99642fbfed52a1842d14fd673fccd3fb541ca1ce531ec322b8b065be2a8fc1b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section focused on restrictive agreements that limit certain actions by the borrower for the lender's protection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Business Day in this context indicates the days on which the Bank processes operations and transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day refers to the days on which the transactions are conducted and notifications must be delivered by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defines a day other than weekends or holidays when transactions can be conducted in the London interbank market."&lt;SEP&gt;"On the first Business Day of each month, the Bank shall notify the Borrower in writing or by readily accessible electronic means."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Business Day refers to the date on which the Advance is requested, as specified by the Borrower in the Request for Advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated days on which transactions and requests such as the Request for Advance are processed under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advances denote the funds provided by the Bank to the Borrower as part of the credit agreement obligations and are critical to the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Advance refers to the amount of funds provided to the Borrower by the Bank under the facility, which must be repaid according to the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Advance refers to the amount of funds that may be disbursed by the Bank to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Advance refers to the amount of money disbursed by the Bank to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement, which the Borrower must repay."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Advance refers to the funds that the Bank provides to the Borrower, which are governed by the terms of the Agreement and may be subject to indemnity provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Advance represents the amount of money that the Bank agrees to provide to the Borrower under the credit agreement, contingent on fulfilling specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An amount of money that the Bank is willing to lend to the Borrower, subject to agreement terms and legal stipulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest accrued on a monthly basis on each Advance shall be payable on each Interest Payment Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advance refers to the financial amount requested by the Borrower under the terms set out in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERNST &amp; YOUNG LLP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ernst &amp; Young LLP is an independent public accounting firm tasked with auditing the Borrower's financial statements to ensure they comply with GAAP."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ernst &amp; Young LLP is an independent public accounting firm that audited the Borrower's financial statements, providing assurance regarding their accuracy and compliance with GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEGATIVE COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section outlining the negative obligations of the borrower, which restrict certain actions that could jeopardize the lender's interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Aggregate Advances refer to the total amount of money that the Borrower has borrowed from the Bank under the credit agreement, which must be repaid on the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total amount of all Advances made under the Trade Finance Facility Agreement that are not repaid."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CODE SECTIONS 103(B)(2) AND 148&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"References to specific sections of the Internal Revenue Code that define parameters for tax-exempt status of bonds, impacting the interest owed on Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESOLUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Resolutions represent formal decisions by the Borrower required by the Bank for compliance with the terms of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CITIBANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution that provides loans and credit facilities to banks, corporations, and consumers, in this case, extending financing to Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank is a financial institution mentioned as the bank account recipient for the funds due under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e99642fbfed52a1842d14fd673fccd3fb541ca1ce531ec322b8b065be2a8fc1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8.01 outlines the procedures for notices and other communications between the Borrower and the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section outlining the notice requirements related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE IN LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any alterations in statutory regulations that may affect the cost or terms of the Advances provided by the Bank to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Change in Law refers to any legislative or regulatory alterations that could affect the Borrower's execution of the agreement and utilization of Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any changes in laws or regulations that may affect the contractual obligations of the Borrower or the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE RESERVE PERCENTAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Interest Rate Reserve Percentage is the applicable percentage that affects the reserves the Bank must hold concerning Eurocurrency liabilities during the advance period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Environmental Law encompasses regulations that govern the Borrower's operations to ensure compliance with environmental standards and liabilities, critical for avoiding penalties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENTS OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section specifying the conditions under which the borrower may be considered in default, impacting the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific conditions that, if breached, trigger a default under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE SPREAD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An additional rate added to the LffiOR Floating Pool Rate to calculate the overall Default Rate applicable to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any such adjustment to the Applicable Spread shall be effective as of the date of the occurrence of the Adjustment Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Applicable Spread is the margin added to the LIBOR Floating Pool Rate to determine the final interest rate charged to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount added to the base interest rate, which adjusts based on credit ratings, influencing the cost of borrowing under the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document within the Facility Documents that evidences the Borrower's obligation to repay the advances made by the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal instrument confirming the terms of debt issued to the Borrower, representing their obligation to repay borrowed funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"A promissory note substantially in the form of Exhibit A, outlining the borrower's obligations to repay the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note is a legal document that outlines the borrower's promise to repay the loan amount along with interest, serving as a key instrument in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note serves as evidence of the Borrower's obligations to the Bank regarding the repayment of Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OPINIONS OF COUNSEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Opinions of Counsel are legal assessments deemed necessary by the Bank regarding compliance with the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An agreement where the bank commits to providing advances on an uncommitted revolving basis as outlined in the overall credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.01 defines the structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank may assign to one or more assignees all or a portion of its rights and obligations under this Agreement including all or a portion of the Facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility refers to the loan structure established under the Agreement, including terms for advances and repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility refers to the structured credit arrangement outlined in the agreement, under which Advances are made to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific structured credit arrangement outlined in the credit agreement, which is valid and binding obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Facility shall terminate at such time if conditions are not satisfied or waived."&lt;SEP&gt;"the structured credit or loan arrangement detailed in the Agreement and recognized by the GDB Resolution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8.02 describes the conditions under which waivers and amendments to the agreement may occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section about waivers and amendments to the agreement, detailing how changes can be made."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITAL LEASE OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capital Lease Obligations refer to long-term lease agreements that are considered financial obligations on a balance sheet, impacting overall Indebtedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital Lease Obligations refer to the financial commitments incurred by the Borrower to finance the acquisition, construction, or improvement of fixed or capital assets, as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of the Borrower to pay rent or other amounts under leases classified as capital leases according to GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indebtedness (other than the Advances) or obligations in respect of one or more Hedge Agreements, of any one or more of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries in an aggregate principal amount exceeding $10,000,000."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Indebtedness refers to significant debts that the Borrower must manage and may influence the terms of the credit agreement if not honored."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxes represent financial obligations that the Borrower and its Subsidiaries must fulfill, including timely filing and payment, critical for maintaining legal compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVERS; AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section addressing the process for waiving terms or amending the credit agreement as required."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACILITY AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specifies the total amount of $250,000,000 available under the facility agreement but subject to reduction as per specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement, which includes the amounts and conditions for borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Amount refers to the total credit available to the Borrower under the agreement, which can be terminated or reduced by the Borrower in specified increments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The aggregate principal amount that the Bank may advance to the Borrower, which is subject to limits defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The maximum amount available for advances to Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority under the terms of the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal decision that is adopted by the Borrower including necessary actions related to the Transactions under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to formal actions passed by the governing body of the Bank or Authority, relevant for establishing terms within Facility Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The documented resolutions adopted during the execution of transactions related to the Agreement and other Facility Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;10 BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"10 Business Days refers to the timeframe mutually agreed upon for the Bank to notify the Borrower of any extensions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advances are amounts that the Bank may provide to the Borrower under the conditions specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances are financial transactions where the Borrower or its Subsidiaries provide funds to another party or acquire financial interests, subject to specific stipulations in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances refer to the funds provided by the Bank to the Borrower under the Agreement, which must be repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances refer to the loans or funds provided to the Borrower under the terms of the Facility, which need to be repaid according to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances refer to the principal amounts provided by the Bank to the Borrower under the terms of the credit agreement, which are subject to repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amounts disbursed by Citibank, N.A. to Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority, as specified under the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds that the Bank agrees to provide to the Borrower under the terms of the Facility, with specific conditions outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds that the Bank may make available to the Borrower from time to time during the Availability Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds that the Borrower may incur or issue for the purpose of repaying obligations as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds that the Borrower may receive or repay in connection with its financial arrangements under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.02 details the provision of funds that lenders commit to the borrower under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advances represent the financing provided by the Bank to the Borrower, which the Borrower is obligated to repay, including interest and fees as defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank may assign to one or more assignees all or a portion of its rights and obligations under this Agreement including the Advances at the time owing to it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The funds provided by the Bank to the Borrower under the terms of the credit agreement, subject to the terms outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term Advances signifies the amounts that are made available by the Bank to the Borrower for specific purposes outlined in the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the funds that may be disbursed to the Borrower under the terms of the Facility as authorized by the GDB Resolution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228c502c8880a404029e4a01d826cc4e22cf95111ea9fdd014095cae26e5c434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
