  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section regarding expenses, indemnity, and damage waivers relevant to the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to fees or costs associated with the loan as outlined in Section 8.12 of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The fees or payments that may be associated with the Advance, which must adhere to legal regulations, such as the Maximum Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063</data>
