</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCLOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disclosure refers to the Borrower's obligation to transparently convey information about agreements and restrictions that could affect its legal and financial status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNING LAW; JURISDICTION; CONSENT TO SERVICE OF PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section defining the legal framework governing the credit agreement and the jurisdiction in which disputes will be handled."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVAILABLE AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Available Amount is the maximum principal amount that can be drawn by the Borrower under the credit agreement during the Availability Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The available funding amount at any given time based on the Facility Amount and cumulative Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GDB RESOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific approval or decision that the Borrower must adopt as part of compliance with the agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific resolution mentioned in the context of the transactions and agreements executed by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Resolution EC-2012-63, adopted on July 9, 2012 by the Government Development Bank for Puerto Rico, authorizing this Agreement, the Facility and the Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific resolution relevant to the agreement, likely involving the Government Development Bank, impacting terms of the facility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.07&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.07 describes the terms for extending the Availability Period and Maturity Date following the Bank's review."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8.04 outlines the provisions regarding Successors and Assigns, including the bindings of the Agreement for the parties and their respective successors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section on the survival and reinstatement of obligations under the agreement following termination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
