</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PARTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity mentioned in Section 8.04(b)(i) that is involved in the agreement and its arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank may sell participations to one or more other entities (a 'Participant') in all or a portion of the Bank's rights and obligations under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Participant refers to any entity that takes part in the credit agreement, entitled to certain benefits under the terms established in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45</data>
