</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event indicating that the Borrower has failed to meet an obligation or condition stipulated in the Agreement, which could allow the Bank to take remedial actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default indicates a failure by the Borrower to meet its obligations under the Agreement, critical for evaluating financial health and risks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
