</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE LIMITATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing the limitations on the interest rate that can be applied to the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANCE DUE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Advance Due Date is the specific date on which the Borrower is required to pay back the Advance received from the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advance Due Date is the specific deadline by which the requested funds must be repaid, as outlined in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific due date set for repayment of each Advance, defined as the 270th day following the funding of that Advance under the terms of the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL RESERVE SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"transactions with members of the Federal Reserve System arranged by Federal funds brokers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721</data>
