</node>
<node id="&quot;PREPAYMENT OF ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PREPAYMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.06 outlines the terms under which the borrower can repay part or all of the loan before the maturity date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8.05 states that certain covenants, agreements, and representations made by the Borrower shall survive beyond the execution of the Agreement, ensuring ongoing obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section that addresses counterparts, integration, and the effectiveness of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45</data>
