</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Current Expenses are the expenses classified under the financial agreements that the Borrower must account for, as specified in the Trust Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Current Expenses are the regular operational costs that the Borrower intends to cover using the proceeds from the Advances according to the Trust Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Current Expenses comprise obligations that must be prioritized under the Trust Agreement, reflecting the financial structure of repayment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations defined in the Trust Agreement pertaining to the Borrower's operational costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations that are payable by the Borrower from the funds established under the Trust Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payments that are defined under the Trust Agreement, which are expected to be covered by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERMITTED LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liens imposed by law for taxes not due or being contested, securing obligations that are not overdue, arising in the ordinary course of business."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f</data>
