</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agreements encompass other contracts and understandings to which the Borrower is subject, influencing the overall obligations and rights defined in the primary Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT A PROMISSORY NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exhibit attached to the credit agreement providing details regarding the loan's terms and the borrower's promise to repay."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUSTMENT EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjustment Event refers to changes that may affect the Applicable Spread due to changes in the credit rating of the Senior Debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event that may necessitate modifications or adjustments in the Agreement due to changes in circumstances affecting the Borrower or the loan's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event that triggers certain clauses or adjustments in the terms of the Trade Finance Facility Agreement, ensuring compliance with stipulated conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
