<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section focusing on severability, ensuring that if parts of the agreement are invalidated, the rest remains enforceable."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
