</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMONWEALTH OF PUERTO RICO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Commonwealth of Puerto Rico governs the Note's conditions and interpretation, as stated in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The governmental authority related to the Borrower that does not hold responsibility for the debt of the Borrower under the agreement, as stated in the promissory note."&lt;SEP&gt;"The jurisdiction under which the Borrower operates and is governed within the context of this agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The political jurisdiction that encompasses Puerto Rico, whose laws and official documents are underscored in the context of jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fd617d0485c978e60e12da1e457bda833d1b87dd45e5f43cd7d0b303b8165b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAXIMUM RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specified upper limit on the interest rate that can be charged for Advances made by the Bank to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The maximum allowable interest rate for loans, defined as the lesser of 12% per annum or the highest lawful rate permitted by law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063</data>
