</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing the provision for financial statements in the credit agreement, outlining the obligations of the borrower regarding financial reporting."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFILIATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to any entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with a specified Person, significant in defining relationships under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL OFFICERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial Officers means the Executive Director, Chief Financial Officer, Treasurer and Assistant Treasurer of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Financial Officers are designated representatives of Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority authorized to make requests for advances under the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TELECOPY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMUNICATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Telecopy refers to the method of communication the Borrower must use to confirm prepayment notifications to the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENTS GENERALLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.10 outlines the timeline for payments relating to the advances made under the facility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.07&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section describing the right of setoff, permitting the lender to offset amounts owed by the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate of interest equal to the sum of three percent (3%) above the LIBOR Floating Pool Rate and the Applicable Spread."&lt;SEP&gt;"The higher interest rate applicable in the event of an Event of Default by the Borrower, serving as a penalty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The higher interest rate applied if an Event of Default occurs and is defined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Borrower's Obligations are detailed in the Agreement, which must be fulfilled as per the terms established."&lt;SEP&gt;"The collective terms and amounts due to the lender as specified in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement, which the Borrower is obligated to fulfill."&lt;SEP&gt;"The responsibilities and commitments of the Borrower as detailed in Exhibit A of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT DEVELOPMENT BANK FOR PUERTO RICO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The governmental body whose approval is necessary for certain financial actions taken by the Borrower and whose consent is expected not to be unreasonably withheld or delayed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section concerning the notices of material events, adjustment events, and legal proceedings that must be communicated under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MOODY'S&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A credit rating agency that assesses the long-term ratings of the Borrower's debt obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A credit rating agency that provides ratings influencing the adjustment of Applicable Spread, vital for determining pricing under the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moody's Investors Service, Inc., a financial services company that provides credit ratings, research, and risk analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moody's is a credit rating agency that assesses the creditworthiness of the Borrower's Senior Debt, affecting borrowing costs and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moody's is a credit rating agency that provides assessments of creditworthiness, important for the Borrower's financial standing as it relates to the Senior Debt."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f</data>
