</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 4.01 states the date on which all parties have signed the agreement, marking the formal commencement of obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Effective Date marks the commencement of the Agreement and associated obligations for both parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which all parties have signed the agreement, marking the formal commencement of contractual obligations and binding terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which conditions precedent are satisfied for the Agreement to be effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date when the terms of the agreement become enforceable and obligations begin for the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"as of the Effective Date there shall not have been a Material Adverse Change."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
