</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional taxes that the Borrower must pay to the Governmental Authority in relation to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that apply to the payments made under the Agreement, including stamp taxes or various excise taxes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35</data>
