</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.03 is a specific provision in the credit agreement denoting the obligations of the Borrower regarding its legal existence and the conduct of business."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section referring to the existence and conduct of the business, ensuring the borrower maintains operational integrity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
