</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Environmental Liability indicates potential financial obligations the Borrower may face concerning environmental claims, reflecting risk associated with compliance with Environmental Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Liability relates to the obligations and potential liabilities faced by the Borrower regarding environmental issues or contamination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liability, contingent or otherwise, resulting from the Borrower or any Subsidiary based on violations of Environmental Laws or associated with hazardous materials."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
