</node>
<node id="&quot;RESOLUTION NO. 3936&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Resolution No. 3936 is a formal decision made by the Borrower, indicating the terms related to the Note and payment provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Resolution No. 3936 of the Borrower, approved on June 29, 2012, authorizing the terms and conditions of this Agreement, the Facility, and the Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
