<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.04 defines the Borrower's responsibilities to pay its obligations in a timely manner to prevent Material Adverse Effects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section highlighting the borrower's obligation to pay their debts and financial obligations related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
