</node>
<node id="&quot;BASIS POINTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A unit of measure used to describe the percentage change in interest rates, specifically relating to the pricing adjustments in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Governmental Authority is a body that has the power to administer laws and regulations which may affect the Borrower and its operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for imposing taxes and regulations during the execution of credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authorities are entities that impose regulations and oversee compliance applicable to the Borrower and its Subsidiaries, impacting legal and operational matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authorities refer to the organizations responsible for enforcing laws and regulations that the Borrower must comply with, as stated in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority refers to the entities responsible for overseeing compliance with laws and regulations that may pertain to the Borrower's operations and transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the entity that potentially requires additional payments from the Bank, indicating involvement of regulatory oversight in the financial transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authority responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower shall pay the full amount deducted to the relevant Governmental Authority in accordance with applicable law."&lt;SEP&gt;"the government of the United States of America, any other nation or any political subdivision thereof, with jurisdiction over the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"amount equal to any additional costs incurred by the Bank due to the Final Determination so that net of such additional costs the Bank receives the amount it would have received had no Final Determination been made."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b</data>
