  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8.10 refers to a specific provision within the Agreement that addresses the waiver of jury trial rights in legal proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section addressing the waiver of jury trial provisions within the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
