</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Related Parties include the affiliates and respective directors, officers, employees, agents, and advisors of any specified Person."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties of the Bank are referenced in a context that implies they might have rights or benefits under the Agreement as explicitly contemplated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
