  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.05 outlines the requirements for the Borrower to maintain properties and insurance adequate for conducting its business."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section on the maintenance of properties and insurance, ensuring that the borrower's assets are adequately protected."</data>
