  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specific adjustments in basis points based on credit ratings provided by Moody's and S&amp;P, affecting the cost of financing under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
