<node id="&quot;GUARANTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Guarantee represents a commitment by the Borrower or its Subsidiaries to secure obligations, providing additional financial assurance as stipulated in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"any obligation, contingent or otherwise, of the guarantor guaranteeing or having the economic effect of guaranteeing any Indebtedness or other obligation of any other Person."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECEIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document issued by the Governmental Authority evidencing the Borrower's payment of taxes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35</data>
