</node>
<node id="&quot;MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"January 10, 2014, as such date may be extended, marking the predetermined due date for loan repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maturity Date signifies the final due date for loan repayment, marking the end of the loan term."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maturity Date is the designated date by which the Borrower must repay all Aggregate Advances, concluding the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maturity Date is the final due date for the Borrower to repay the Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maturity Date is the predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan, marking the end of the loan term when all amounts must be repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined date by which the borrower must repay the loan in full, including any accrued interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final due date for repayment of the loan, which triggers the full obligation to repay."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0577bcf85330f4b00fcdd625a94b8630bba7ca41f50b06e3cdacd4e3894e1b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.11&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8.11 outlines that headings and references within the Agreement are not legally binding in interpretation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section on headings used in the agreement for clarity and organization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LFFIOR FLOATING POOL RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used in calculating the loan's interest rate, as described in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used to calculate the Default Rate, serving as a starting point for determining interest obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LffiOR Floating Pool Rate means the average cost of 30-day LffiOR Rate during the month immediately preceding the corresponding Interest Payment Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccc7901475e465e988eec22f2f995c1cff42aed7f6505014df16c2b388073e10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUISITION INVOICES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documents that the Borrower must provide, which outline the expenses that correspond to the requested Advance and must be reconciled by the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"Invoices that represent amounts currently due and unpaid, indicating a financial obligation tied to the Agreement for a Requested Advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Invoices, purchase orders, or other forms of evidence acceptable to the Bank for payments due in respect of the purchase of goods and services by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Requisition Invoices are documents provided by the Borrower to the Bank that must accompany the Request for Advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The unpaid Requisition Invoices represent the financial obligations that the Borrower intends to fulfill with the funds requested from the Advance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdee22fff5b0749e919bec54cb42823587fab138c06ed283f8b2803032ed517b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de29bb777338fcc5b63dcf005e771862aa08d26f31dace448f6847079a2894c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACILITY DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documents that outline the specific terms and agreements associated with the loan facility, which the Bank reviews and requires signatures on."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Document is included within the overarching Agreement, detailing specific terms associated with the loan and any related facilities provided to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.06 details the obligations of the Borrower to keep proper records and allow inspections by the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section dealing with the requirements for books, records, and inspection rights regarding the borrower's financial practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
