</node>
<node id="&quot;BAA2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A credit rating indicating the borrower's credit risk level, which results in a specific adjustment in the Applicable Spread as detailed in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any financial obligation or debt that the Borrower or any Subsidiary must adhere to as outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness of any Person includes all obligations for borrowed money, deposits, advances, bonds, debentures, notes, and other financial instruments and arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness refers to the financial obligations of the Borrower, including those incurred for financing the acquisition, construction, or improvement of fixed or capital assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations or debts that the Borrower may incur, which are typically secured by liens."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries in respect of one or more financial agreements, which includes various forms of debts and liabilities excluding certain advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"any financial obligation or debt that the Borrower may have under the terms of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document delivered from the Bank to the Borrower confirming the amount of indemnified taxes paid or liability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35</data>
