</node>
<node id="&quot;BELOW BAA3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indicates a credit rating below Baa3, leading to additional adjustments in the Applicable Spread, thus altering borrowing costs under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal decision by a party to relinquish a known right or claim under the agreement, providing temporary flexibility in performance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.12&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8.12 discusses the limitations regarding interest rates applicable to advances made under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section covering the interest rate limitations applicable to the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
