</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term defined in Article VII of the agreement, representing a situation in which the borrower has failed to meet obligations, triggering repercussions outlined in the legal agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Event of Default is defined in the Agreement and triggers specific obligations and consequences for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Event of Default occurs when the Borrower fails to meet the obligations as defined in the Agreement, allowing the Bank to take certain actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Event of Default triggers specific rights for the Bank, allowing setoff against the Borrower when certain conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conditions or events that, if occurred, allow the lender to take action under the credit agreement due to the Borrower's failures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Event of Default denotes situations in which the Borrower fails to meet contractual obligations, triggering higher interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Event of Default is a specified condition that, if triggered, can lead to the termination of the Facility Amount and the immediate obligation of the Borrower to repay the total amount owed to the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
