  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.07 mandates the Borrower to comply with all applicable laws and regulations as a condition of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section focused on the compliance with applicable laws, ensuring the borrower adheres to all legal regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
