</node>
<node id="&quot;HEDGE AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contracts that involve derivative instruments used by the Borrower to manage exposure to risks, particularly interest rate risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hedge Agreements are formal contracts that the Borrower can enter to hedge or mitigate financial risks associated with liabilities or investments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hedge Agreements means any rate swap transaction, basis swap, forward rate transaction, and similar transactions including various financial derivatives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
