  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.08 specifies the intended use of the proceeds from the Advances, ensuring they are allocated to permissible expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section addressing the use of proceeds from the loan, ensuring funds are used for agreed-upon purposes."</data>
