</node>
<node id="&quot;BAA3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A credit rating that signals a higher risk than Baa2, which leads to a specific increase in the Applicable Spread, affecting the terms of the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
