</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST ACCRUAL PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Accrual Period means the period commencing on the first date of each Advance and ending on the earlier of the next Interest Payment Date, the Maturity Date, or any date of prepayment or acceleration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
