  <data key="d2">chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The financial institution providing the loan to the borrower, responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance with the terms of the contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.14&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section focusing on language used in the credit agreement to ensure clarity and comprehension of terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINAL DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Final Determination is the conclusive ruling made by a court or arbitrator concerning any legal proceedings involving the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A decisive ruling or action by regulatory authorities that officially influences the tax status associated with the advances, crucial for compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Final Determination signifies a conclusive assessment which could impact the Borrower's ability to use Advances if deemed unfavorable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Final Determination is a condition that reflects any legal or regulatory decision that can impact the validity of the credit agreement or obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The final ruling that establishes the date when interest on the Advances is deemed includable in the gross income of recipients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon a Final Determination, the Bank shall calculate the amount of interest which accrued on all Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GENERAL PARTNERSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The partnership structure referenced in the text where control is indicated to require more than 50% of general partnership interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT INSTRUCTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Payment Instructions are directives that the Borrower submits to the Bank to initiate fund disbursement."</data>
