  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.09&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing any financial covenants the borrower must adhere to, ensuring fiscal responsibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BBB-&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This rating reflects a further increase in risk relative to BBB and Baa2, impacting the terms under the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST PAYMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Payment Date means the second Business Day of each calendar month, beginning August 2, 2012, and also includes the Maturity Date or any date when principal is paid due to prepayment or acceleration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest accrued on a monthly basis on each Advance shall be payable on each Interest Payment Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Payment Date is the date on which the accrued interest on each Advance is payable to the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Payment Date is the scheduled date on which interest payments are due from the Borrower to the Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREPA LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PREPA Loan refers to the specific loan arrangement under which payments are made, establishing a legal framework for the financial transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.10&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section referring to the tax-exempt status of the borrower, impacting the overall financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The Borrower is defined as any individual, company, or legal entity that receives funds under a credit agreement and is responsible for repaying the loan according to the agreed terms. This includes the obligation to repay any principal amount, as well as any applicable interest and fees associated with the loan. The Borrower is obligated to fulfill these repayment responsibilities even in circumstances where payments are rescinded. 

Identified as the party receiving funds from the Bank, the Borrower must ensure compliance with the obligations outlined in the credit agreement, which also includes providing identifying information as mandated by the USA Patriot Act. Additionally, the Borrower must notify the Bank by specified deadlines regarding any advance requests and waive any claims against indemnities under the agreement.

Overall, the Borrower plays a crucial role in the lending process, being the entity that not only receives the financial support but also commits to the detailed repayment conditions stipulated in the contract.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228c502c8880a404029e4a01d826cc4e22cf95111ea9fdd014095cae26e5c434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "BANK" refers to the financial institution that provides loans to the Borrower under the terms outlined in the credit agreement. It is responsible for disbursing funds, making Advances available to the Borrower, and monitoring compliance with the conditions stipulated in the Agreement. The Bank evaluates and determines the disbursement of funds and retains the right to make such Advances at its discretion based on specific circumstances deemed appropriate. Additionally, the Bank is obligated to comply with legal requirements, including those established by the USA Patriot Act. 

As a lending institution, the Bank oversees the Borrower's obligations, maintains records of the Borrower's indebtedness, and has the authority to take legal action related to the Agreement if necessary. It also holds rights such as setoff against the Borrower’s obligations. Furthermore, the Bank must notify the Borrower of the total amount of interest payable on the Advances, ensuring transparency in its financial dealings. Lastly, the Bank is not required to contribute any funds beyond the interest it receives from the Advances provided to the Borrower, and it expects to receive full payment of all amounts due and owing under any existing facilities.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228c502c8880a404029e4a01d826cc4e22cf95111ea9fdd014095cae26e5c434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f33ee10e7bda5b14fbc09b9aa6e16d8dc1449ced7841bf4be7896621de1063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "AGREEMENT" refers to a formal, legally binding contract that delineates the terms, conditions, and responsibilities of the parties engaged in a trust arrangement, primarily focusing on the financial dealings between the Borrower and the Bank. It outlines the rights, obligations, and terms pertinent to the financing arrangement, which includes details about the disbursement of funds, repayment schedules, interest rates, and collateral requirements.

This contractual document encapsulates the relationship between the Borrower and the Bank, governing the obligations associated with loans and credit arrangements. It specifies the provisions that determine how proceeds from the Requested Advance are managed and how Requisition Invoices are to be handled. Additionally, it prescribes calculations relating to interest rates such as the applicable LIBOR Rate and Default Rate, as determined by the Bank.

The Agreement also ensures that it is the overarching contract that supersedes any prior agreements related to the financial arrangement, binding the parties involved and their respective successors and assigns. It underscores the importance of the representations and warranties made by the Borrower, affirming their accuracy upon each Advance request.

In summary, the Agreement serves as the foundational legal document that governs the financial terms and conditions of the Borrower-Bank relationship, ensuring clarity and enforceability of all associated obligations and rights.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdee22fff5b0749e919bec54cb42823587fab138c06ed283f8b2803032ed517b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c801681ae7db2c79dc705328d1eff621b1067f2817a730b578f231984615295f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7512db866e03064d07553d82c7e6d5c8e89534c374c8143ef109f8e93559313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b53aa3032d7724a08ebc102d9b31f54173425439d5eff944136fbb26b5aa2110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A trustee may be appointed to oversee the compliance of the Borrower with the terms of the credit agreement, particularly in cases of default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENEFICIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The individual or party that will benefit from the trust and receives distributions according to the terms of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b53aa3032d7724a08ebc102d9b31f54173425439d5eff944136fbb26b5aa2110</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE AND COMMUNICATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notice and Communications refer to the formal exchanges of messages between the Borrower and the Bank as specified in the agreement."</data>
