</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Financial Officer is a designated individual within the Borrower’s organization responsible for certifying the accuracy of the financial statements provided to the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Financial Officer of the Borrower is responsible for certifying financial statements and determining the occurrence of any Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Financial Officer or another executive officer of the Borrower is responsible for delivering notices and statements related to financial events or developments in the company."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f</data>
