</node>
<node id="&quot;FINAL NON-APPEALABLE JUDGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The final non-appealable judgment refers to a legal outcome that is conclusively binding and must be recognized in other jurisdictions, as noted in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f</data>
