</node>
<node id="&quot;INSPECTION RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Inspection Rights grant the Bank the authority to inspect the Borrower's properties and accounts to ensure compliance with the terms of the loan."</data>
