</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTED DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The executed date is the date on which the Agreement is formally signed by the parties involved, marking the beginning of its enforceability."</data>
