</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCRUED INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Accrued Interest is the interest that has accumulated on the loan principal over time, which becomes due for payment at the time of loan repayment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624</data>
