</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTARY PUBLIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Notary Public serves as an agent validating the affidavit and the identities of the signatories to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The official who acknowledged and subscribed the affidavit, validating the identity and authority of Josue Antonio Colón Ortiz as Acting Executive Director."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c4187c4c97cb9c42f524362397c7bbedcd1ace1fe2352097eca90b08e8f3b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fd617d0485c978e60e12da1e457bda833d1b87dd45e5f43cd7d0b303b8165b</data>
