</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Indemnitee refers to a person or entity that is protected under the indemnity provisions of the Agreement and holds a position regarding losses or claims arising from the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indemnitee is involved in claims for losses, damages, and liabilities, and may incur legal or other reasonable expenses in connection with investigations or defenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3</data>
