</node>
<edge source="&quot;EVENT OF TAXABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The behavior of the Borrower in managing the proceeds of advances can lead to an Event of Taxability, affecting tax implications."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">Tax Compliance&lt;</data>
