</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SENIOR DEBT&quot;" target="&quot;TRUST AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Senior Debt is defined under the Trust Agreement, detailing its nature and security provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">"definition"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SENIOR DEBT&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Senior Debt refers to bonds that are issued by the Borrower and typically not guaranteed by another Person."</data>
  <data key="d6">"debt obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SENIOR DEBT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must meet certain financial ratings and obligations related to the Senior Debt as required by the Bank."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower owes Senior Debt to the Bank, which represents a priority claim over other financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"debt obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;commitment to borrower&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SENIOR DEBT&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank is involved in the provisioning and management of the Senior Debt, which is crucial to the Borrower's financing structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Senior Debt must satisfy specific rating requirements set by the Bank."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"lending agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"rating, obligation"&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EVENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Events impacting the Bank's costs or returns are monitored and reported to maintain compliance with the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"monitors compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agent is responsible for coordinating between the Borrower and Lender, managing the agreement’s operational aspects."</data>
  <data key="d6">"coordination role"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-27e959b2b2ebf635e7efa5c4d57ee3a43c19d2c3fe045f2cae758e858a15c58c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HAZARDOUS MATERIALS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower faces potential claims related to the presence of Hazardous Materials on properties it owns or operates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for managing Hazardous Materials to avoid liabilities under Environmental Laws."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Environmental Responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"environmental liability"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3</data>
