  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;HEDGE AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Subsidiary can enter into Hedge Agreements to mitigate risks associated with their financial liabilities, reflecting the Borrower's overall risk management strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Subsidiary is permitted to enter into Hedge Agreements as a means to hedge or mitigate their own financial risks."</data>
  <data key="d6">"risk management, agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower controls the Subsidiary and is responsible for its compliance with the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower controls the Subsidiary, which is involved in transactions like mergers, investments, and financial obligations as per the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may have legal obligations that extend to its Subsidiaries under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may include any Subsidiary, which is defined as a company under the control of the Borrower and influences its credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiary is indirectly associated with the Borrower's operations under the control of the Parent Company."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Corporate Structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"control relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"control"&lt;SEP&gt;"control, transaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d593bf0583582d4937727ed1d91d746a466f5010e2fe8b361ecb3d629c95c411</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Subsidiary can provide Advances to the Borrower or any other Subsidiary as part of intercompany financial support agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial support, transaction"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-daad2f3588bad2455de1559ee12fdec505b0a1a9d0dc8c6fce496c95b63eacf8</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNING BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower submits monthly financial reports to its Governing Board for review and approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">"submits reports"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-db84678c63d545d66d2a4ad2b52d64d1986befb367966046663550e6c2059083</data>
