  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6.01 regarding liens may be influenced by fundamental changes defined in Section 6.02, impacting the lender's security."</data>
  <data key="d6">"liens, fundamental changes"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-30d5da1e570cd1d0941d9b6a28b64186b40ed88acf01afb35bad27680e12232f</data>
