</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EUROCURRENCY LIABILITIES&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank incurs liabilities related to Eurocurrency funds, which impacts interest calculations on the Advances."</data>
  <data key="d6">"incurs liabilities"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1153d2ce9781f421ef9f8a96cfad97b1d0733ca1ff10f84a402988b66edf1e41</data>
