</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DETERMINATION OF TAXABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank must ensure that no Determination of Taxability exists before making Advances to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">"ensures compliance"</data>
