</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIDOR RATE&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank determines the applicable LIDOR Rate which is used to calculate interest for the Borrower."</data>
