</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Lien can be against a Person's property as a security for outstanding Indebtedness, giving lenders claims to specific assets if obligations are unmet."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Security Interest, Obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0aae36cc9f3bd8d010bf4d399d95a5d5d1128b238b823cbd73a39e5d17e90a77</data>
