  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is subject to the potential imposition of a lien on their assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may be restricted from creating additional Liens on its property as a condition of maintaining existing debt obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"asset security"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial obligation, restriction"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc</data>
