</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRUST AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">67.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower agrees to follow the terms specified in the Trust Agreement relating to payments and other obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower and its Subsidiaries are bound by the terms and conditions established in the Trust Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a party to the Trust Agreement, making it legally bound to the terms set forth in the agreement regarding its financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound by the provisions in the Trust Agreement, which govern the management of funds and affect the Borrower's repayment terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound by the terms outlined in the Trust Agreement, which governs the financial arrangements and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound by the terms set forth in the Trust Agreement relating to various obligations and legal proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement accompanies the borrower's responsibilities regarding investment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trust Agreement governs the financial obligations and terms outlined for the Borrower’s debts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proceeds of the loan are to be used as stipulated in the Trust Agreement, which outlines conditions for the usage of funds and compliance requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">"agreement obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"binding obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"governing document"&lt;SEP&gt;"investment obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"legal obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"party to agreement, legally bound"&lt;SEP&gt;"use of proceeds, requirements"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebf25dd09fd0ed913393086258363a4d89fbba7e722941eac930ed8d6c51144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228c502c8880a404029e4a01d826cc4e22cf95111ea9fdd014095cae26e5c434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
