  <data key="d5">"Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority is making a request for an Advance as stated in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement.""&lt;SEP&gt;"The Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority is a party to the Trade Finance Facility Agreement as represented by Josue Antonio Colon Ortiz."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The agreement outlines the borrowing terms and obligations of the Borrower regarding the loan from Citibank."&lt;</data>
