<edge source="&quot;PUERTO RICO ELECTRIC POWER AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;CITIBANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Citibank provides financing to the Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority under the terms of this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"PUERTO RICO ELECTRIC POWER AUTHORITY entered into a TRADE FINANCE FACILITY AGREEMENT with CITIBANK, N.A. to outline the lending and financing terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"PUERTO RICO ELECTRIC POWER AUTHORITY is the Borrower obtaining Advances from CITIBANK, N.A., the lender, as per the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."|&gt;"borrower-lender"&lt;SEP&gt;"Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority is borrowing funds from Citibank, N.A. under the terms of the Trade Finance Facility Agreement.""&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower promises to repay the loan to the Lender as outlined in the Trade Finance Facility Agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"9"&lt;SEP&gt;"borrowing"&lt;SEP&gt;"contractual agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"lender-borrower"</data>
