<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">42.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrower oversees and controls its Subsidiaries, engaging in transactions and financial arrangements as stipulated in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower and its Subsidiaries must comply with corresponding obligations, ensuring financial cohesion and legality.")&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower controls the Subsidiaries, which are integral to its business operations and financial performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has oversight and control over its Subsidiaries, which must comply with the same terms defined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may be held accountable for the liabilities and obligations related to its Subsidiaries under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower will ensure that its Subsidiaries adhere to the same obligations and conduct necessary for maintaining business operations under the terms of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"accountability"&lt;SEP&gt;"compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"control, compliance, governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"control, transaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"maintenance, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"ownership, business structure"</data>
