  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liens are established on fixed or capital assets by the Borrower to secure Indebtedness incurred during asset financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens on the Borrower's assets may occur if the terms of the agreements are not met or if there is a default, impacting the security interests of creditors."</data>
  <data key="d6">"potential claims, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"security, obligation"</data>
