<edge source="&quot;ADVANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interest accrued on a monthly basis on each Advance shall be payable on each Interest Payment Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank disburses an Advance to the Borrower upon satisfaction of specific conditions."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank grants Advances to the Borrower, which are subject to repayment according to the contractual terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank provides Advances to the Borrower, under the conditions set forth in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank provides an Advance to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"disbursement, funding"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"financial transaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"fund disbursement"&lt;SEP&gt;"funding"&lt;SEP&gt;funding relationship&lt;</data>
