  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Facility represents the structured credit arrangement that the Borrower is obliged to adhere to."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility stipulates the terms and conditions under which the Borrower is provided Advances by the Bank."</data>
