</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FACILITY&quot;" target="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Facility is defined to manage the Advances committed to by the lenders in the credit agreement."</data>
