<edge source="&quot;FACILITY AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank manages the terms and conditions associated with the Facility Amount as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Amount represents the maximum principal amount that the Bank may provide as Advances to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">"manages terms"&lt;SEP&gt;"sets limit"</data>
