  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FACILITY AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is obligated to comply with terms regarding the Facility Amount in relation to the Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Amount is defined and controlled by the Borrower, who can terminate or reduce it as per the agreement terms."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligates compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;control&lt;</data>
