<edge source="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank is committed to providing Advances to the Borrower under the terms specified, establishing a financial relationship within the Facility."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank may assign to one or more assignees all or a portion of its rights including the Advances at the time owing to it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank provides Advances to the Borrower based on the terms of the credit agreement, which may be altered by Events."</data>
  <data key="d6">"assignment"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides funding"&lt;SEP&gt;Financial Relationship&lt;</data>
