  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">57.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Advances are drawn by the Borrower from the Available Amount during the Availability Period under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower can incur Advances for fulfilling repayment obligations, showcasing the credit arrangement's operational aspects.")&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower can request Advances from the Bank, acknowledging that the facility is uncommitted and subject to the Bank's discretion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has the potential to receive Advances from the Bank but only under certain conditions that must be met."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to repay the Advances received from the Bank, including interest and fees specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may receive Advances, which are crucial for meeting its financial commitments and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives Advances from the Bank which it is obliged to repay as per the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"conditional commitment"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial arrangement, funding"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial management"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"receives funds, repayment obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"requests funding"&lt;SEP&gt;financial arrangement, obligation</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e56751c6d99e047c24a9b0a28b1abbe37fa3eb085d81378e942e156a0d9b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb356deeb3d4c5fb5ce8f06a814fbadd22e30c5fa7d0ecc40d7e10362fd8b2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228c502c8880a404029e4a01d826cc4e22cf95111ea9fdd014095cae26e5c434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feafca318473c2316c5b5fbb760515cfce14f9fecabeefd14d3004dd70bf2767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae6f1b44fde448e8d90f9b213d6e78b2589be1d60ea14292ed56f6eda296624</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
