</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTICIPANT&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank has obligations to ensure that Participants are entitled to benefits outlined in the Agreement, thus establishing a responsibility toward them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank may sell participations to one or more other entities (a 'Participant')."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Participant enters into relationships with the Bank through assignments or participations outlined within the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligations to participants"&lt;SEP&gt;"participation agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"participation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45</data>
