  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a Default occurs, it may trigger consequences outlined in the Agreement, impacting the Borrower's obligations to the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of a Default indicates the Borrower's failure to comply with obligations in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"non-compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation, consequence, agreement"</data>
