</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADVANCE DUE DATE&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank sets the Advance Due Date as the date when any principal amount of the Advance becomes due from the Borrower."&lt;</data>
