</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURRENT EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank acknowledges that all obligations under the Agreement constitute Current Expenses, highlighting their financial importance and priority."&lt;</data>
