</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURRENT EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Current Expenses are obligations of the Borrower, to be paid from the General Fund as part of their financial commitments.")&lt;SEP&gt;"Current Expenses are the types of expenses that the Borrower must account for under the terms specified in the Trust Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's obligations for repayment include components classified as Current Expenses under the Trust Agreement."&lt;</data>
