<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">51.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower makes payments related to taxes owed to the Governmental Authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must comply with the laws, regulations, and orders set forth by Governmental Authorities to avoid legal repercussions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's operations are governed by regulations set by Governmental Authorities, influencing its compliance and legal standing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's transactions do not require consent from any Governmental Authority, indicating compliance with relevant regulations to proceed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Governmental Authority has jurisdiction over the Borrower and its transactions"&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower shall pay the full amount deducted to the relevant Governmental Authority in accordance with applicable law."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Regulatory Oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Payments"&lt;SEP&gt;"compliance, no consent required"&lt;SEP&gt;"compliance, regulations"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight, compliance, governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"regulatory compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f37ef461fd5888168e939fb3f4581ccf94e805b763a6b1d095fa068bf8d659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb9b7fb2566d1ef23c654ca95d8c88a248b85df0bbe2d654b4c3f4f2e37a81d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0678d958db442fcb1252228bf16e5bad67dc5abb758474a551ca176e51e721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b10a8831e936d119a7b8bae39d0b793e1042b00dc9b4257147b5151c8c9a6</data>
