  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank may be required to make additional payments to the Governmental Authority under certain conditions according to the agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank must comply with regulations set forth by the Governmental Authority overseeing credit agreements and lending practices."</data>
