  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must ensure that the terms regarding the Maturity Date are met for the repayment of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must repay the Advances by the Maturity Date as stipulated in the Agreement."</data>
