  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank requires that the Borrower repays the loan by the Maturity Date, marking the conclusion of the loan term."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank specifies the Maturity Date that marks the deadline for the Borrower to repay the total amounts owed under the credit agreement."&lt;</data>
