  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower assumes various Indebtedness obligations as defined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower incurs Indebtedness to finance the acquisition, construction or improvement of fixed or capital assets, ensuring that it does not exceed certain limits as specified."</data>
