<edge source="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If an Event of Default occurs, the Borrower may face penalties, including the immediate repayment of amounts owed on the Note."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must comply with specific covenants to avoid events of default that could trigger penalties."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of an Event of Default affects the Borrower's rights and obligations under the Agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Compliance Requirement"&lt;SEP&gt;"affects"&lt;SEP&gt;"default clauses"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-08cef172c2592d496e50f2cf885901cae232a13897063fc83b0e4da5506e053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793b82ba61d8d3df6b2178413bb43c204842ea2b33c010d06b7760c7a16a60a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3</data>
