</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If an Event of Default occurs, it triggers the Bank's rights to terminate the Facility Amount and demand repayment from the Borrower."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank is entitled to take actions if an Event of Default occurs, including declaring the Borrower's obligations due."&lt;SEP&gt;"The agreement includes provisions that outline what constitutes an Event of Default concerning the obligations of the Borrower toward the Bank."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"enforcement"&lt;SEP&gt;Contractual Obligations&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;default clause&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af814de598788717015978597f629049b6048f29e5a15558cffdc54d334ef7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d935cdb23d367f6da922a752649dd2d9fb71ea290c708c57e695ca11bf6831</data>
