<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">222.0</data>
  <data key="d5">The Bank and Borrower are engaged in a formal lender-borrower relationship as outlined in the credit agreement. The Bank provides Advances to the Borrower under specified conditions and expectations of repayment according to an agreed schedule. It disburses funds to the Borrower, which is contractually obligated to fulfill the terms of the Agreement, including the repayment of the loan and any accrued interest.

The Bank oversees compliance with the agreement, ensuring the Borrower meets all conditions necessary for the provision of Advances. Moreover, the Bank maintains rights regarding the Borrower's obligations, enabling it to monitor the Borrower’s adherence to the terms stipulated in the credit agreement. The Borrower, in turn, is responsible for notifying the Bank in advance of the date of any requested Advance and must indemnify the Bank for any tax-related obligations that arise under the agreement.

In addition to repayment responsibilities, the Borrower is restricted from transferring any rights or obligations without the Bank's prior written consent. Ultimately, the Borrower is obligated to repay the funds received from the Bank in accordance with the stipulated terms of the Agreement, highlighting the formal financial relationship between the two entities.</data>
  <data key="d6">" loan provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnification"&lt;SEP&gt;"assignment"&lt;SEP&gt;"lender-borrower relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending"&lt;SEP&gt;"lends to"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan provision, repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification, obligation"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation, provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversees compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"payment obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides financing"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides funding"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides funds"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides funds, liable for repayments"&lt;SEP&gt;"receives funds, responsible for repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"reliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"repayment obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"repayment obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"repayment, funding, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;Borrowing relationship, Loan Obligations&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;borrower to lender&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;financing, obligation&lt;SEP&gt;lending relationship&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;repayment obligation&lt;</data>
