<edge source="&quot;BANK&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">98.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agreement governs the relationship and obligations of the Bank in providing financing to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agreement outlines the rights and obligations of the Bank and Borrower, detailing the financing arrangements and terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agreement sets forth the conditions under which the Bank provides financing to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank and Borrower have an agreement governing the terms of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank disburses funds under the terms stated in the Agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank governs the terms of the Agreement, under which it provides the Advances to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank has created an Agreement which governs the terms of the loan provided to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank is a party to the Agreement, stipulating the terms of the loan and obligations of the Borrower, as well as rights granted to the Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank is a party to the Agreement, which outlines the rights and obligations related to the financing provided to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank is a party to the Agreement, which outlines the terms and conditions of the loan provided to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank is authorized under the Agreement to enforce legal actions against the Borrower or its properties if necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank provides the loan based on the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank's evaluation of conditions precedes the obligations set forth in the Agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank's obligations and rights are defined under the Agreement, establishing the framework of their relationship."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The calculation of the applicable LIBOR Rate, LIBOR Floating Pool Rate, Default Rate and the other calculations required in this Agreement, as determined by the Bank, shall be conclusive."&lt;SEP&gt;"The provisions of this Agreement shall be binding upon and inure to the benefit of the parties hereto."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Contractual Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"binding"&lt;SEP&gt;"contractual obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"contractual relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"enforcement, legal action"&lt;SEP&gt;"governing terms"&lt;SEP&gt;"governs"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation, evaluation"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"party to agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"providing loan"&lt;SEP&gt;"terms of agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;Contractual Framework&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;lender to agreement&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-8f2f1160e9faff6f277cb14cbdbac457679da678506fc659a1e6b446d495e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2630b7f24a2555aecd7c3d3b01bcf5e14541b13c1919513f1b14b1a56b40f016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c42f3d3d211c5ef0d9f7201f2500164a1f26c263d9af2bcd8364530cb3c6dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08330e624b008011709b83b5a2c8cb88d4036d409681528bf5227b76772566b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad77acda1b68541d5e2bdb49d6cebee502795dfeefa164f0cd2f7a67daae17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee5390db4c81e6a3b72054fd834f99fdd4cb8d125b870b7c1cf7a322a93313f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec14b1a14c93b7acdcda9750eadec1907007f2b8e4c45de9fd3cbd7b3185719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b92c0465e98efd4fa0b7641463065685edef1cf5485cee87260c13496a89a18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c78753b3331bcf7ddbb72049ab994b78870b8f45e13fad8256dcc68e5ac35055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6483b89d8474c3175ab80800ca62d48d26e38ff4249f98f921cfff87d7c6b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bfac8012b6107c0ddfbee3827a0dfb767ee1c9751eb69c707880b143391df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba0e4f47b0e553ccd6f5062b6c7c378edac106f815baf1c48db6325d9004518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69880123a942b71389eae87885f4e6f8047e37bffef362044d1e638a1fcd08a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2ba336c239569c1217438ac6133ac1cd66c12d79fbebe344ab54ad5c78da35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0698bc3602d3fa5329accd914b55b61d6fca91548227dcb8b192769cff1a41f</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-d78f3a912cf6a0d022b78fa6955d54764af5f4e9ad6a1aef69147ba45f381b9c</data>
